{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15212440","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15212440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1521244001:1":{"text":"ソルス、いつもの実力が出せてないみたいね。","source_cn":"索斯，这似乎不是你平时的实力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB26C23C5DC939C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521244002:0":{"text":"すみません、ちょっとコンディションが……","source_cn":"……抱歉，状态不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE209F27F38F8EE78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521244003:0":{"text":"言い訳はいい。どうして怪我を隠してたの？","source_cn":"别找借口，受伤就是受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99920F01848DEACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521244004:0":{"text":"ルアには休養をすすめておいて。","source_cn":"鲁受伤的时候你还劝他回去休息，怎么轮到自己就一声不吭了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63510C2CA32CE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521244005:0":{"text":"腕を少し痛めただけで、狩りに支障はないからですよ。","source_cn":"只是胳膊受了一点伤，不算什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE80940A35540E064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521244006:1":{"text":"それに、バルに知られたら何を言われるか。","source_cn":"我也不想被巴知道。那家伙的嘴一向不饶人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B5E8006A984CCB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521244007:1":{"text":"はぁ……どいつもこいつも意地っ張りばかり……","source_cn":"哼，你倒是倔得很。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF1E59DBD96C5419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521244008:1":{"text":"私たちが来なかったら、さっきの暴獣にどう対処するつもりだったの？誤魔化しがきくような相手じゃないのよ。","source_cn":"要是我们不来，你准备怎么对付刚才的暴兽？它可不是吃素的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8B4FCD390206D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521244009:1":{"text":"もちろん策はありましたよ。だから武器を落としても、その場を立ち去らなかったんです。","source_cn":"我自然有办法。否则就不会在武器脱手后还站在原地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9DF87C512A4AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1521244009":{"text":"もちろん策はありましたよ。だから武器を落としても、その場を立ち去らなかったんです。","source_cn":"我自然有办法。否则就不会在武器脱手后还站在原地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9DF87C512A4AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521244010:1":{"text":"暴獣には二つの弱点があります。それさえ知っていれば、武器なしでも戦えるんですよ。","source_cn":"暴兽有两个弱点。只要知道这两点，没有武器也能对付它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345D7CFAE48AAE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521244011:1":{"text":"一つ目は、身体上の弱点。\n<style=\"highlight\">腹部</style>こそ、ヤツの最も脆い部分です。","source_cn":"第一个是它身体上的弱点。\\n<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BC945EAD893CE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521244012:1":{"text":"そして二つ目は、習性に関する弱点です。\n<style=\"highlight\">やられたフリでもして地面に倒れる</style>と、ヤツは徐々に警戒を緩めるでしょう。","source_cn":"第二个是它习性上的弱点。\\n一旦<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E16471395DFFD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521244013:1":{"text":"つまり暴獣に対峙したとき、形勢が不利になれば倒れて死んだフリ、警戒が緩んだところで腹部めがけて攻撃すればいいんです。","source_cn":"所以独自对战暴兽时，如果落了下风，只要看准时机倒地装死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28967DED132BFC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521244014:1":{"text":"完全に警戒が解けるまでに少し時間を要しますが、この戦法ならほぼ確実に仕留められます。","source_cn":"虽然等它完全放松需要一定时间，但这个方法几乎不可能失手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A6C9A6C99CF592D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:15212